# SwiftUI

- Prefer Observation (`@Observable`) over new `ObservableObject` unless existing code requires Combine.
- Configure `FirebaseApp.configure()` in `App.init()` before Auth-dependent state.
- Feature views consume `DesignSystem` palette tokens; do not inline hex.
- Keep pure nutrition maths in `Core/` with no SwiftUI or network imports.
- iPhone-first layouts; do not expand multiplatform UI in V1 feature work.
